Z||000000||Getaway2k||06-16-2000||10:13 PM||||Let me start out by saying that I NEVER race my 86 Fiero GT. Tonight, I made an exception. I'm at the light when up pulls what I believe to be a Honda Civic (too many neon lights and stickers to tell for sure). This whack-job has the nads to rev his engine while he and a passenger look over at me (I swear his car sounded like a 125cc motorbike engine). Anyway, the light goes GREEN(!), I smack the gas pedal, my Fiero grabs onto the road and takes off like a bat out of hell. His headlights continued to fade in my rear view mirror as I drove on. I hope the youngin' appreciates the lesson he was taught tonight. Class dismissed!<P>[This message has been edited by Getaway2k (edited 06-16-2000).]<p>[This message has been edited by Getaway2k (edited 06-17-2000).]||||reg||14
